2. UI/controller integration (where hover currently triggers graph changes)

* Stop calling `setMetric()` per hovered entity unless the entity type actually changes the series set
* Call `setSubject(...)` on hover change instead

You generally do **not** need to touch `projection.js` unless you want to share the projection cache across multiple graph controllers.

