## Summary of what Option C changes in performance terms

* **Before:** hover often triggers a “cache rebuild” that can include state reconstruction from timeline + serialization for many seconds. 
* **After:** hover triggers only **series extraction** from already-cached per-second states; state reconstruction happens only when the timeline changes (revision bump) or when you request seconds not yet cached.


